</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>There’s a hand that I hold on to, Thru each valley and each trial.</l><l>There’s a shoulder that I lean upon,</l><l>As I face another mile.</l><l>There’s a love I can depend on, It’s fresh and new each day.</l><l>And with joy my heart is overflowing, So this is why I say.</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
